    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Singal would have remained just another unheard, unseen idyllic town of Gilgit-Baltistan, if it were not for its middle schools making their mark across its home Ghizer district. This year, the top four positions in the public Middle/Primary Standard Annual Examination 2014 at district Ghizer level have been clinched by two schools of Singal, both of whom are collaborators of a secondary school, a learning resource school, run by the Institute for Educational Development's Professional Development Centre, North. While not a single student failed in the recent examination, the LRS itself had bagged the top three positions in the Middle/Primary Standard Annual Examination 2013.",
